<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Pengaturan - Kopi Senja</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800 font-sans flex h-screen overflow-hidden">
    <aside class="w-64 bg-[#111827] text-white flex flex-col h-full shadow-lg z-10 flex-shrink-0">
        <div class="p-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="bg-white text-[#111827] font-extrabold text-xl p-2 rounded-md">KS</div>
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-wide">Kopi Senja</h1>
        </div>
        <nav class="flex-1 mt-4 px-4 space-y-2">
            <a href="/" class="block px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition">Dasbor</a>
            <a href="/produk" class="block px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition">Etalase Menu</a>
            <a href="/riwayat" class="block px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-800 hover:text-white transition">Riwayat Promo</a>
            <a href="/pengaturan" class="block px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-800 text-white font-semibold transition shadow-inner">Pengaturan</a>
        </nav>
    </aside>

    <main class="flex-1 h-full overflow-y-auto p-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Pengaturan Sistem</h2>
        <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6">
            
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-blue-100 border-l-4 border-l-blue-500">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Informasi Outlet (Prompt Context)</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4">Data ini disisipkan ke sistem AI agar hasil promosi lebih akurat mengenali bisnis Anda.</p>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">Nama Brand / Kafe</label>
                        <input type="text" value="Kopi Senja" class="w-full border p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm bg-gray-50">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">Target Audience Utama</label>
                        <input type="text" value="Mahasiswa UMY dan pemuda lokal Jogja" class="w-full border p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm bg-gray-50">
                    </div>
                    <button class="bg-[#111827] text-white font-bold py-2 px-6 rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-gray-800">Simpan Profil</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-purple-100 border-l-4 border-l-purple-500">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2">🔑 Konfigurasi API Kecerdasan Buatan</h3>
                    <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">Connected</span>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">Provider AI</label>
                        <select class="w-full border p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm bg-gray-50">
                            <option>Google Gemini API</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between">
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">API Key (Rahasia)</label>
                            <a href="#" class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-500">Ubah</a>
                        </div>
                        <input type="password" value="•••••••••••••••••••••••••••••" class="w-full border p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm bg-gray-50" readonly>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>